            <string>StudWorks is a free CAD program for creating virtual LEGO® models with the LDraw parts library.
It is built on LeoCAD by Leonardo Zide and released under the GNU General Public License version 3.
Part connections use the LDCad shadow library by Roland Melkert.</string>
           </property>
